# The news collection is intentionally empty.
#
# While no visible news entry exists, the site renders no news section, no
# /news/ page and no navigation item — not even a placeholder.
#
# Adding a Markdown file here, for example 2026-09-01-first-paper.md with:
#
#   ---
#   date: 2026-09-01
#   title: Paper accepted at ACL 2027
#   summary: Optional one-line context.
#   url: https://example.org/paper
#   visible: true
#   ---
#
# makes the home-page section, the /news/ page and the nav link appear
# automatically. See README.md for details.
